## E-mail sent to administrators during the users synchronization when EPFL LDAP web service did not return information about user affiliations
##
## Parameters: {0} is the sciper id, {1} is the user name
##
#set($subject = 'Infoscience: Error during user synchronization')
For user having sciper ${params[0]} (${params[1]}) there are no units in DSpace-CRIS matching accreditations returned by EPFL LDAP.
